                </label>
                <label class="fb-field">
                    <span class="fb-label">Godmode@(Tip("Takes no damage at all. Only a ban kills it."))</span>
                    <input type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" @bind="play.Godmode"/>
                </label>
                <label class="fb-field">
                    <span class="fb-label">Speedhack@(Tip("Moves faster than anyone can run."))</span>
                    <input type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" @bind="play.Speedhack"/>
                </label>
                <label class="fb-field">
                    <span class="fb-label">Spinbot@(Tip("Spins like a top while it walks at its target."))</span>
                    <input type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" @bind="play.Spinbot"/>
                </label>
                <label class="fb-field">
                    <span class="fb-label">Bunny hop@(Tip(
                        "Bunny hops, and now and then clears a low wall with a jump far higher than anyone can."))</span>
                    <input type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" @bind="play.BunnyHop"/>
                </label>
                <label class="fb-field">
                    <span class="fb-label">Teleports in fights@(Tip(
                        "Now and then teleports behind its target mid-fight. It shouts a moment before and needs a moment "
                        + "after landing before it can shoot."))</span>
                    <input type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" @bind="play.FightTeleport"/>
                </label>
                <label class="fb-field">
                    <span class="fb-label">Flying@(Tip("Hovers in the air over its target."))</span>
                    <input type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" @bind="play.Fly"/>
                </label>
                <label class="fb-field">
                    <span class="fb-label">Loot vacuum@(Tip(
                        "Looters always have it. Every half minute the best loose items within 150 m fly into its bag "
                        + "(they drop with its body). With nothing in range it walks to the best loot further off, and once "
