                    <input type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" @bind="play.Vacuum"/>
                </label>
                <label class="fb-field">
                    <span class="fb-label">Voice spam@(Tip("Spams Scav ahead or Hold fire nonstop. Only heard within 80 m."))</span>
                    <input type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" @bind="play.VoiceSpam"/>
                </label>
                <label class="fb-field">
                    <span class="fb-label">Aim accuracy@(Tip(
                        "Scales how often an aimbot shot lands (0 to 1). At 0.7 a closet cheater lands about half its aimbot "
                        + "shots, mostly to the body, and a rage cheater most of them, mostly to the head."))</span>
                    <input type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" @bind="play.AimAccuracy"/>
                </label>
                <label class="fb-field">
                    <span class="fb-label">Reaction time@(Tip(
                        "Scales how long a cheater takes to shoot once it sees you (0.5 to 3, higher is slower)."))</span>
                    <input type="number" min="0.5" max="3" step="0.1" @bind="play.ReactionTime"/>
                </label>
                <label class="fb-field">
                    <span class="fb-label">Speedhack multiplier@(Tip("How much faster (1 to 6) a speedhacker moves."))</span>
                    <input type="number" min="1" max="6" step="0.1" @bind="play.SpeedMultiplier"/>
                </label>
            </div>
        </section>
        }
        <section class="fb-card">
            <h2>In-raid anticheat</h2>
            <p class="fb-muted">Every cheater builds up suspicion as it plays: each teleport, flight, impossible jump, spin
                and headshot counts. The more it has, the sooner it drops dead mid-raid, banned on the spot.</p>
            <div class="fb-switch-row">
                <label class="fb-switch">
                    <input type="checkbox" role="switch" @bind="play.BanNotice"/>
                    <span class="fb-switch-track"></span>
                    Tell me about bans@(Tip("Shows a notification when a cheater in your raid gets banned."))
                </label>
            </div>
            <div class="fb-grid">
                <label class="fb-field">
                    <span class="fb-label">Ban chance per minute@(Tip(
                        "Chance (0 to 1) each minute that an average cheater is banned mid-raid. 0.02 bans about a third of "
                        + "them in a 20-minute raid. 0 turns in-raid bans off."))</span>
                    <input type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" @bind="play.BanPerMinute"/>
                </label>
                <label class="fb-field">
                    <span class="fb-label">Blatant play raises it@(Tip(
                        "How much suspicion counts (0 to 3). At 1 a rage cheater that flies and teleports is gone within "
                        + "minutes, while a closet cheater can last several raids. 0 bans everyone at the same rate."))</span>
                    <input type="number" min="0" max="3" step="0.1" @bind="play.BlatantBanBoost"/>
                </label>
            </div>
        </section>
    }
    <section class="fb-card">
        <h2>Bans</h2>
        <p class="fb-muted">A banned cheater is gone for good. Banned profiles stay viewable in All players under Banned.</p>
        @{ var bans = Store.RecentBans(8); }
